{"id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md","title":"Complex Vector Bundle","display":"df-complex-vector-bundle — Complex Vector Bundle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complex-vector-bundle","aliases":["58-df-complex-vector-bundle","Complex Vector Bundle"],"display":"df-complex-vector-bundle — Complex Vector Bundle","depends_on":["[[58-df-vector-bundle]]","[[58-df-complex-manifold]]","[[58-df-biholomorphism]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complex-vector-bundle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complex-vector-bundle</span><span>Complex Vector Bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-vector-bundle — Complex Vector Bundle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"58-df-vector-bundle\">58-df-vector-bundle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"58-df-complex-manifold\">58-df-complex-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d06636b21adf739\" href=\"?note=2d06636b21adf739\" title=\"58-df-biholomorphism\">58-df-biholomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2bc9d494c7bff68e\" href=\"?note=2bc9d494c7bff68e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,\\pi\\in V\">\\(E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,\\pi\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\">\\(r\\in\\omega\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb C,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb C,r)\\)</span> is the scalar-field-sensitive predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"58-df-vector-bundle\">58-df-vector-bundle</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_x = \\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\">\\(E_x = \\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\)</span>（点逆像纤维）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (rank-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> complex-vector-bundle predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,n)\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"58-df-complex-manifold\">58-df-complex-manifold</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S(\\phi,\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,U,n,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S(\\phi,\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,U,n,r)\\)</span> exposes the two ambient topologies and dimensions</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> is the predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>各纤维的复向量空间运算沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md\">../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md</a> 的固定族；不能由当前局部坐标临时赋予不同运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_x=\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\">\\(E_x=\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C^r}=\\{W\\subseteq\\mathbb C^r:\\forall z\\in W\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C^r\\;(\\sum_{j\\in r}|w(j)-z(j)|^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\to w\\in W)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C^r}=\\{W\\subseteq\\mathbb C^r:\\forall z\\in W\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C^r\\;(\\sum_{j\\in r}|w(j)-z(j)|^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\to w\\in W)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{U\\times\\mathbb C^r}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\},\\mathbb C^r,\\tau_{\\mathbb C^r})\">\\(\\tau_{U\\times\\mathbb C^r}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(U,\\{O\\cap U:O\\in\\tau_X\\},\\mathbb C^r,\\tau_{\\mathbb C^r})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_\\alpha=U_\\bullet(\\alpha)\">\\(U_\\alpha=U_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_\\alpha=\\phi_\\bullet(\\alpha)\">\\(\\phi_\\alpha=\\phi_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,r\\in\\omega\">\\(n,r\\in\\omega\\)</span>。积的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2\\)</span> 沿用向量丛文件的实际投影图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinIso}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2bc9d494c7bff68e\" href=\"?note=2bc9d494c7bff68e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FiberwiseComplexLinear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\phi,\\pi,U,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\omega\\land U\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}\\pi\n\\land\\phi\\in(U\\times\\mathbb C^r)^{\\pi^{-1}[U]}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\n\\mathrm{LinIso}_{\\mathbb C}\n\\left(\\{\\langle e,\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\phi(e))\\rangle:e\\in\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\},\n\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}],\\mathbb C^r\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FiberwiseComplexLinear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\phi,\\pi,U,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\omega\\land U\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}\\pi\n\\land\\phi\\in(U\\times\\mathbb C^r)^{\\pi^{-1}[U]}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\n\\mathrm{LinIso}_{\\mathbb C}\n\\left(\\{\\langle e,\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\phi(e))\\rangle:e\\in\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\},\n\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}],\\mathbb C^r\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb C,r)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb C,r)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}trivialization}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S(\\phi,\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,U,n,r)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\in\\tau_X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S\\!\\left(\n\\phi,\\pi^{-1}[U],\\{O\\cap\\pi^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_E\\},n+r,\nU\\times\\mathbb C^r,\\tau_{U\\times\\mathbb C^r},n+r\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{pr}_1\\circ\\phi\n=\\pi\\upharpoonright\\pi^{-1}[U]\n\\land\\operatorname{FiberwiseComplexLinear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\phi,\\pi,U,r).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}trivialization}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S(\\phi,\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,U,n,r)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\in\\tau_X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S\\!\\left(\n\\phi,\\pi^{-1}[U],\\{O\\cap\\pi^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_E\\},n+r,\nU\\times\\mathbb C^r,\\tau_{U\\times\\mathbb C^r},n+r\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{pr}_1\\circ\\phi\n=\\pi\\upharpoonright\\pi^{-1}[U]\n\\land\\operatorname{FiberwiseComplexLinear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\phi,\\pi,U,r).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n,r)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(E,\\tau_E,n+r)\n\\land\\exists I,U_\\bullet,\\phi_\\bullet,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(U_\\bullet,I,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\phi_\\bullet,I,C)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}U_\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S(\\phi_\\alpha,\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,U_\\alpha,n,r)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n,r)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(E,\\tau_E,n+r)\n\\land\\exists I,U_\\bullet,\\phi_\\bullet,C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(U_\\bullet,I,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\phi_\\bullet,I,C)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}U_\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicTrivialization}_S(\\phi_\\alpha,\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,U_\\alpha,n,r)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topological part is an exact specialization of the canonical vector-bundle predicate to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\mathbb C\">\\(k=\\mathbb C\\)</span>.  Holomorphic trivializations now expose domain/codomain topologies and dimensions, cover the base through typed families, and commute with the bundle projection.</li>\n<li>纤维复线性在断言中由固定运算下的实际线性同构表达，不再依赖元理论占位说明。</li>\n<li>Complex vector bundle: fiber <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}^r\">\\(\\mathbb{C}^r\\)</span>; transition functions in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GL(r,\\mathbb{C})\">\\(GL(r,\\mathbb{C})\\)</span></li>\n<li>Chern classes: characteristic classes for complex bundles; real rank <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2r\">\\(2r\\)</span></li>\n<li>The first Chern class of a complex line bundle lies in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^2(X;\\mathbb Z)\">\\(H^2(X;\\mathbb Z)\\)</span> once the Chern-class construction is fixed.</li>\n<li>The tautological line bundle over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{CP}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{CP}^n\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O(-1)\">\\(\\mathcal O(-1)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O(1)\">\\(\\mathcal O(1)\\)</span> is its dual.</li>\n<li>Dolbeault: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\partial\">\\(\\bar\\partial\\)</span>-operator; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\partial}\">\\(\\overline{\\partial}\\)</span> cohomology computes sheaf <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^p\">\\(\\Omega^p\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bott and Tu, Differential Forms in Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Huybrechts, Complex Geometry&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-vector-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-bundle]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-biholomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d06636b21adf739","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-biholomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"2bc9d494c7bff68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb C,r)$ is the scalar-field-sensitive predicate from [[58-df-vector-bundle]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,n)$ is the predicate from [[58-df-complex-manifold]]","embed":fa